{'symbol': 'MRO', 'date': '2021-03-30 17:07:00', 'title': 'MARATHON OIL ANNOUNCES $500 MILLION GROSS DEBT REDUCTION', 'text': 'HOUSTON, MARCH 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARATHON OIL CORPORATION (NYSE: MRO) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT SENT AN IRREVOCABLE NOTICE OF ITS INTENTION TO FULLY REDEEM ITS CURRENTLY OUTSTANDING $500 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 2.8% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2022 (THE "NOTES") ON APRIL 29, 2021 (THE "REDEMPTION DATE").\xa0 THIS TRANSACTION WILL REDUCE GROSS DEBT BY\xa0$500 MILLION\xa0AND ANNUAL CASH INTEREST EXPENSE BY\xa0$14 MILLION.'}